<title>UK: SOCCER-KILMARNOCK WIN SCOTTISH F.A. CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-KILMARNOCK WIN SCOTTISH F.A. CUP.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kilmarnock beat Falkirk 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) to win the Scottish F.A. Cup final at Ibrox</p>
<p>Stadium on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Paul Wright 21</p>
<p>Attendance: 49,000.</p>
</text>
